    "text": "Showers will occur at times in Northern, North-central and Eastern provinces. Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places elsewhere in the island after 1.00 p.m. Fairly heavy falls above 75mm are likely at some places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, Uva , North-western provinces and in Galle and Matara districts.",
