  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      554.02,
      552.5,
      590.11
    ],
    "text": "Misty conditions may prevail in Western, Sabaragamuwa and Central provinces and in Galle, Matara and Badulla districts during the early hours of the morning.",
